<div id="A4.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">Step 4 (final).</span> Now we average over the iterates and apply the bounds derived in Lemmas <a href="#Thmthm2" title="Lemma 2. ‣ D.1 Key Lemmas ‣ Appendix D Convergence Analysis of MT-DAO-SGDM ‣ Appendix ‣ MT-DAO: Multi-timescale Distributed Adaptive Optimizers with Local Updates" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> and <a href="#Thmthm3" title="Lemma 3. ‣ D.1 Key Lemmas ‣ Appendix D Convergence Analysis of MT-DAO-SGDM ‣ Appendix ‣ MT-DAO: Multi-timescale Distributed Adaptive Optimizers with Local Updates" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.</p>
