<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><span id="A4.Ex45.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">from Lemma <a href="#Thmthm3" title="Lemma 3. ‣ D.1 Key Lemmas ‣ Appendix D Convergence Analysis of MT-DAO-SGDM ‣ Appendix ‣ MT-DAO: Multi-timescale Distributed Adaptive Optimizers with Local Updates" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a></span></td>
