<div id="A4.SS1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text">Denote <math id="A4.SS1.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{x}=(1-p_{x})(1+s),\;q^{\prime}_{x}=(1-p_{x})(1+\nicefrac{{1}}{{s}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mpadded voffset="0.3em"><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></mpadded><mpadded style="width:-0.15em;" lspace="-0.1em" width="-0.15em"><mo stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo></mpadded><mi mathsize="0.700em">s</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{x}=(1-p_{x})(1+s),\;q^{\prime}_{x}=(1-p_{x})(1+\nicefrac{{1}}{{s}})</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A4.SS1.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{j}=(1-p_{j})\beta_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{j}=(1-p_{j})\beta_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>. Combining the previous two bounds, we get</span></p>
