<div id="A4.SS1.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS1.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text">Averaging over the iterates and plugging this bound to the previous one, we get</span></p>
